Verified: Alice=knight, Bob=spy, Charlie=knave is the unique solution.
```

The program brute-forces all 3! = 6 role permutations, evaluates each statement's truth value under that assignment, and keeps only the assignments where every speaker's statement is consistent with their role. Exactly one assignment survives, matching the reasoning above.
